### Staff Service API Testing
### Base URL: http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff

### 1. Get All Staff (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff?page=0&size=20
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get Staff by ID
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff/1
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Create New Staff Member
POST http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "EMP001",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "john.smith@airline.com",
  "staffRole": "PILOT",
  "department": "FLIGHT_OPERATIONS",
  "hireDate": "2020-03-15",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 4. Update Staff Member
PUT http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "EMP001",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "john.smith@airline.com",
  "staffRole": "PILOT",
  "department": "FLIGHT_OPERATIONS",
  "hireDate": "2020-03-15",
  "status": "ON_LEAVE"
}

### 5. Delete Staff Member
DELETE http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff/1
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Get Staff by Role
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff/role/PILOT
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Get Staff by Status
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff/status/ACTIVE
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Get Staff by Hire Date Range
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff/hire-date?startDate=2020-01-01&endDate=2023-12-31
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Get All Available Roles
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff/roles
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Get All Available Statuses
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff/statuses
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Get All Available Departments
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/staff/departments
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. Test Health Check
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/test/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 13. Test Info Endpoint
GET http://localhost:8222/api/v1/test/info
Content-Type: application/json

### Notes:
### - All endpoints go through the Gateway (port 8222)
### - The Gateway routes /api/v1/staff/** to the staff-service
### - Staff service runs on port 8083 internally
### - Database: PostgreSQL (airops_staff database)
### - Service Discovery: Eureka (port 8761)
### - Configuration: Config Server (port 8888)
